# PSR-5i — same-SHA proofs inventory

## PSR-5 item 7 intent

> migration، restore، RLS probe و outbox effect روی **همان release SHA** اجرا شوند.

This wave is **inventory + recipe only**. It does **not** execute
`phase-5:gate`, `ci:integrity`, `test:full`, or any Postgres-heavy proof chain
(Verification Policy — requires Architect **YES**).

## Four proof families

| Family | Purpose | Canonical recipe (when YES) | Static assets inventoried |
| --- | --- | --- | --- |
| **Migration** | schema deploy on admin URL | `pnpm run db:migrate:deploy` (+ `DATABASE_URL_ADMIN`) | Prisma migrate scripts under `@apps/api` |
| **Restore** | backup/restore mechanics | `bash scripts/restore-drill-smoke.sh` | script + `.github/workflows/restore-drill-monthly.yml` |
| **RLS probe** | tenant isolation | `pnpm run guard:repository-rls` + targeted `*.postgres.spec.ts` / `rls-*.spec.ts` | guard + listed specs |
| **Outbox effect** | relay/claim under RLS | Postgres outbox specs (e.g. `outbox-rls-forbidden-access.spec.ts`) under `STORAGE_DRIVER=prisma` | listed specs |

## Same-SHA binding rule

A future **live evidence pack** must record for each family:

1. `git rev-parse HEAD` (identical across all four)
2. command + exit code
3. timestamp / CI run URL (if GHA)
4. env profile (`DATABASE_URL` present, `STORAGE_DRIVER=prisma` where required)

Until that pack exists, item 7 status is
`inventory_complete_live_proof_pending` — **not** gate-closed.

## Explicit non-goals (this wave)

- Running `phase-4:gate` / `phase-5:gate` / `ci:integrity`
- Claiming PSR-5 fully closed
- Changing migration or RLS SQL

## Smoke

```bash
node scripts/ops/psr-5i-same-sha-proofs-smoke.mjs
```

Validates inventory paths exist and `live_proof_complete: false`.

## Next (Architect YES required)

Propose a single disposable Postgres session that runs the four recipes on tip
SHA and writes
`docs/audits/snapshots/<date>/psr-5i-same-sha-live-evidence.yaml`.
